<title>UK: Harrisons &amp; Crosfield H1 pretax slips.</title>
<headline>Harrisons &amp; Crosfield H1 pretax slips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.7		    vs 5.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.6		    vs 3.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     64.0		   vs 66.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.02 billion	 vs 1.03 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 63.0 to 65.0 million stg.</p>
